Datasets
--------
- BindingDB: experimentally determined protein–ligand affinities.
  Liu et al., Nucleic Acids Research (2007). https://www.bindingdb.org/
- ChEMBL identifiers appear in curated `input/ligands_nodubl/` filenames.
  https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl/
- RCSB PDB structures in `input/proteins/`. https://www.rcsb.org/

Evaluated methods (install separately; see docs/INSTALL.md)
----------------------------------------------------------
- QVina2 (qvina02)
- GNINA 1.3
- DynamicBind
- Boltz-2
- PLAPT / WELP-PLAPT
- PoseBusters (pose validity; PLAPT is excluded because it does not generate poses)

Python import paths `docking_benchmark2` and the environment variable
`TOXAFFINITY_ROOT` are historical identifiers. The public benchmark name is
AffiTox.
